OL,5,G0010 999: On the Front Line
OL,6,     FParamedics help a man who has
OL,7,     Fcollapsed in the street, a man who
OL,8,     Fis vomiting blood, and a woman
OL,9,     Fwith severe abdominal pain.
OL,10,G0115 24 Hours in A&E
OL,11,     FA young man is treated for a
OL,12,     Fsevere reaction to a recreational
OL,13,     Fdrug, while 65-year-old Christine
OL,14,     Ffrom Camberwell is brought in to
OL,15,     FKing's by her friends after
OL,16,     Fbanging her head.
